orm/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#renueva-por-lotes","content":"Renueva por lotes"},"499":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#cierra-el-solapamiento","content":"Cierra el solapamiento"},"500":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#revocación-en-cascada","content":"Revocación en cascada"},"501":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#comprobaciones-después-del-cambio","content":"Comprobaciones después del cambio"},"502":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","content":"La jerarquía determina el alcance de cualquier error o compromiso. Una raíz firma CAs intermedias; las intermedias emiten las identidades que usan dispositivos y servicios. Esta separación permite aislar entornos y rotar una rama sin reemplazar toda la confianza."},"503":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#diseña-la-jerarquía","content":"Para una instalación de producción, utiliza una raíz muy restringida y una o más intermedias operativas. Separa intermedias cuando cambie alguno de estos límites:"},"504":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#diseña-la-jerarquía","content":"entorno, como producción y preproducción;"},"505":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#diseña-la-jerarquía","content":"propietario o equipo operador;"},"506":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#diseña-la-jerarquía","content":"familia de dispositivos o proceso de fabricación;"},"507":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#diseña-la-jerarquía","content":"región o requisito regulatorio;"},"508":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#diseña-la-jerarquía","content":"motor criptográfico o política de clave;"},"509":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#diseña-la-jerarquía","content":"ventana de mantenimiento y ritmo de renovación."},"510":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#diseña-la-jerarquía","content":"Evita jerarquías profundas sin una necesidad concreta. Cada nivel añade distribución de cadena, validación y otro certificado que debes renovar."},"511":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#diseña-la-jerarquía","content":"Una CA hija y los certificados finales deben expirar antes que su emisor. Reserva un margen que permita distribuir otra cadena y renovar los certificados dependientes."},"512":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#reemisión-y-rotación-no-son-lo-mismo","content":"**Reemitir una CA** crea un certificado nuevo sobre la clave existente. Lamassu genera una CSR con esa clave, autofirma si es una raíz o pide a la CA padre que firme si es subordinada. El nuevo certificado queda activo y la CA apunta a su número de serie; los certificados anterior y nuevo quedan enlazados mediante metadatos."},"513":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#reemisión-y-rotación-no-son-lo-mismo","content":"**Rotar una CA** crea una clave y una autoridad sucesoras. Es la opción adecuada ante compromiso, cambio criptográfico, migración de motor o política de claves no exportables."},"514":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#reemisión-y-rotación-no-son-lo-mismo","content":"Lamassu no permite reemitir una CA ya revocada ni una CA cuya fecha de expiración haya pasado. Anticípate a ambas condiciones."},"515":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#cuándo-elegir-cada-operación","content":"Reemite si la clave sigue siendo confiable y solo necesitas otro periodo de validez o un certificado actualizado."},"516":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#cuándo-elegir-cada-operación","content":"Rota la clave si existe sospecha de compromiso, cambia el algoritmo o quieres mover la custodia a otro motor."},"517":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#cuándo-elegir-cada-operación","content":"Crea una rama paralela si no puedes actualizar todos los consumidores al mismo tiempo."},"518":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#cuándo-elegir-cada-operación","content":"Revoca inmediatamente solo cuando el riesgo de mantener la CA supera el impacto de interrumpir la flota."},"519":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#inventaría-las-dependencias","content":"Localiza CAs hijas, certificados emitidos, DMS, conectores y almacenes de confianza externos. Incluye dispositivos que pueden permanecer desconectados durante semanas o meses."},"520":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#crea-la-ca-sucesora","content":"Genera una clave nueva en el motor previsto, crea la CA y asígnale un perfil explícito. No reutilices el identificador operativo para ocultar que es una generación distinta."},"521":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#distribuye-la-nueva-confianza","content":"Añade la nueva raíz o cadena a los consumidores antes de emitir con ella. En un DMS, utiliza las CAs gestionadas de `/cacerts` para mantener temporalmente las cadenas antigua y nueva."},"522":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#cambia-la-emisión","content":"Actualiza la CA de enrolamiento y el perfil de los DMS. Mantén las CAs de validación adicionales si todavía deben aceptarse certificados antiguos durante el re-enrolamiento."},"523":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#renueva-por-lotes","content":"Migra una cohorte pequeña, valida mTLS, OCSP y CRL desde el consumidor y amplía progresivamente. Supervisa qué dispositivos siguen presentando la cadena antigua."},"524":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#cierra-el-solapamiento","content":"Cuando ningún consumidor legítimo dependa de la autoridad anterior, retírala de la emisión y de las CAs distribuidas. Revócala si la política lo exige."},"525":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#revocación-en-cascada","content":"Al revocar una CA, Lamassu actualiza también sus CAs hijas y certificados emitidos a `REVOKED` con razón `CessationOfOperation`. Las revocaciones de las hijas propagan el efecto a sus propias ramas."},"526":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#revocación-en-cascada","content":"Esto protege la coherencia de la jerarquía, pero convierte la revocación en una acción de gran impacto. No la utilices como mecanismo ordinario para dejar de emitir: primero completa la migración y elimina la CA de los flujos operativos."},"527":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-38","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#comprobaciones-después-del-cambio","content":"La cadena nueva termina en un ancla instalada por el consumidor."},"528":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-39","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#comprobaciones-después-del-cambio","content":"Los certificados nuevos contienen AKI, SKI, KU, EKU y SAN esperados."},"529":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-40","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#comprobaciones-después-del-cambio","content":"El DMS entrega la cadena correcta mediante EST `/cacerts`."},"530":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-41","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#comprobaciones-después-del-cambio","content":"El re-enrolamiento acepta la identidad antigua durante el periodo previsto."},"531":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-42","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#comprobaciones-después-del-cambio","content":"OCSP y CRL responden para las autoridades que siguen activas."},"532":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-43","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#comprobaciones-después-del-cambio","content":"No quedan DMS emitiendo accidentalmente desde la CA anterior."},"533":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-44","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#comprobaciones-después-del-cambio","content":"Consulta el Modelo de confianza para entender los conjuntos de CAs del DMS y Ciclo de vida de un certificado para los estados y efectos de revocación."},"534":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"page","content":"Autoridades de certificación","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Operar Lamassu"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/certificate-authorities"},"535":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","content":"Crea, importa y opera las autoridades que establecen la confianza de tu PKI."},"536":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#elige-un-flujo","content":"Elige un flujo"},"537":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#crea-una-autoridad-nueva","content":"Crea una autoridad nueva"},"538":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#antes-de-empezar","content":"Antes de empezar"},"539":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/certificate-authorities