24/platform/pki/overview#automatiza-identidades-de-dispositivos","content":"Automatiza identidades de dispositivos"},"2084":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/overview-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/overview#publica-el-estado-de-validación","content":"Publica el estado de validación"},"2085":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/overview-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/overview#reacciona-a-los-eventos","content":"Reacciona a los eventos"},"2086":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/overview-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/overview#elige-tu-recorrido","content":"Elige tu recorrido"},"2087":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/overview-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/overview#referencia-operativa","content":"Referencia operativa"},"2088":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/overview-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/overview","content":"Lamassu IoT centraliza la emisión, distribución, renovación y revocación de identidades X.509 para dispositivos conectados. Puedes construir una PKI privada, proteger sus claves y automatizar el enrolamiento de una flota sin perder visibilidad sobre cada certificado."},"2089":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/overview-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/overview#empieza-aquí","content":"<Card title=\"Primeros pasos\" description=\"Crea una CA, emite un certificado y registra tu primer dispositivo.\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview\" />"},"2090":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/overview-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/overview#empieza-aquí","content":"<Card title=\"Cómo funciona Lamassu\" description=\"Construye el modelo mental de autoridades, claves, identidades y validación.\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview\" />"},"2091":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/overview-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/overview#construye-tu-jerarquía-de-confianza","content":"Crea autoridades raíz e intermedias o importa una PKI existente. Define qué autoridad puede emitir cada identidad y conserva la cadena de confianza completa."},"2092":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/overview-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/overview#protege-las-claves-criptográficas","content":"Genera y custodia claves mediante motores software, HSMs PKCS#11 o servicios cloud. Lamassu desacopla las operaciones de la ubicación física de la clave."},"2093":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/overview-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/overview#emite-y-controla-certificados","content":"Emite certificados desde la consola o a partir de un CSR, consulta su estado y revócalos cuando dejan de ser fiables."},"2094":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/overview-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/overview#automatiza-identidades-de-dispositivos","content":"Define políticas de enrolamiento mediante un Device Management Service (DMS) y deja que los dispositivos soliciten o renueven su identidad a través de EST o CMP."},"2095":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/overview-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/overview#publica-el-estado-de-validación","content":"Ofrece validación online mediante OCSP y distribuye CRLs para consumidores que necesitan comprobar certificados sin conexión."},"2096":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/overview-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/overview#reacciona-a-los-eventos","content":"Suscríbete a cambios del ciclo de vida y envía notificaciones por correo, Microsoft Teams o webhooks."},"2097":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/overview-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/overview#elige-tu-recorrido","content":"<Card title=\"Administro la PKI\" description=\"Configura motores, autoridades, emisión y validación.\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/key-management\" />"},"2098":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/overview-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/overview#elige-tu-recorrido","content":"<Card title=\"Integro un dispositivo\" description=\"Configura el DMS y usa EST o CMP para obtener una identidad.\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/device-enrollment\" />"},"2099":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/overview-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/overview#elige-tu-recorrido","content":"<Card title=\"Opero la plataforma\" description=\"Despliega Lamassu y prepara sus dependencias.\" href=\"/docs/deployment/overview\" />"},"2100":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/overview-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/p