l recorrido más corto para entender cómo Lamassu relaciona una entidad física con su historial de identidades."},"2174":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#antes-de-empezar","content":"Un DMS configurado."},"2175":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#antes-de-empezar","content":"Una CA asociada al DMS."},"2176":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#antes-de-empezar","content":"Un identificador único para el dispositivo."},"2177":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#registra-el-dispositivo","content":"Abre **Managed Devices**, selecciona la acción para registrar un dispositivo y completa:"},"2178":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#registra-el-dispositivo","content":"**Device ID**: identificador único del dispositivo."},"2179":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#registra-el-dispositivo","content":"**Registration Authority**: DMS que aplicará las políticas de enrolamiento."},"2180":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#registra-el-dispositivo","content":"**Icon** y **Tags**: clasificación opcional para localizarlo después."},"2181":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#comprueba-el-estado-inicial","content":"Abre el dispositivo recién creado. Debe aparecer con estado **No Identity**: existe en el inventario, pero todavía no tiene un certificado asociado."},"2182":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#asigna-una-identidad","content":"Selecciona **Assign Identity**. Lamassu buscará certificados activos cuyo `Common Name` coincida con el `Device ID`."},"2183":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#asigna-una-identidad","content":"Selecciona un certificado existente o usa **Issue New Instead** para emitir uno desde una CA vinculada al DMS."},"2184":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#verifica-el-dispositivo","content":"Tras confirmar, el estado debe cambiar a **Active**. Revisa **Certificate History** para comprobar la identidad asociada y **Device Event Timeline** para ver el evento de asignación."},"2185":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#automatiza-el-siguiente-dispositivo","content":"El registro manual ayuda a entender el modelo, pero una flota debe usar enrolamiento automatizado. Continúa con Device Management Service y la integración EST o CMP."},"2186":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"page","content":"Resolución de problemas","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Administrar Lamassu"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting"},"2187":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting","content":"Diagnostica acceso, salud, emisión, enrolamiento y dependencias en un despliegue de Lamassu."},"2188":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting#secuencia-de-diagnóstico","content":"Secuencia de diagnóstico"},"2189":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting#reproduce-una-sola-operación","content":"Reproduce una sola operación"},"2190":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting#separa-cliente-gateway-y-servicio","content":"Separa cliente, Gateway y servicio"},"2191":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting#revisa-el-estado-de-kubernetes","content":"Revisa el estado de Kubernetes"},"2192":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting#consulta-el-servicio-afectado","content":"Consulta el servicio afectado"},"2193":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting#valida-el-resultado-desde-fuera","content":"Valida el resultado desde fuera"},"2194":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting#recogida-mínima-de-evidencias","content":"Recogida mínima de evidencias"},"2195":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"No puedo iniciar sesión"},"2196":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting#todo-devuelve-403-o-5xx","content":"Todo devuelve 403 o 5xx"},"2197":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"Un pod no está Ready"},"2198":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting#la-emisión-falla","content":"La emisión falla"},"2199":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting#el-enrolamiento-est-falla","content":"El enrolamiento EST falla"},"2200":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting#ocsp-o-crl-no-reflejan-un-cambio","content":"OCSP o CRL no reflejan un cambio"},"2201":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"Los eventos no llegan"},"2202":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting#observabilidad","content":"Observabilidad"},"2203":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting","content":"Empieza por localizar la capa que falla. Una respuesta del Gateway, un pod no preparado y una emisión rechazada pueden parecer el mismo problema desde la consola, pero requieren evidencias distintas."},"2204":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting#reproduce-una-sola-operación","content":"Anota hora en UTC, usuario o principal, recurso, endpoint y resultado. Evita repetir una acción destructiva como revocación o eliminación."},"2205":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting#separa-cliente-gateway-y-servicio","content":"Comprueba el código HTTP. Un 401 apunta a autenticación; un 403, a autorización; un 404, a ruta o recurso; un 5xx, al servicio o una dependencia."},"2206":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting#revisa-el-estado-de-kubernetes","content":"Localiza pods no preparados, reinicios, eventos recientes y el estado del release."},"2207":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting#consulta-el-servicio-afectado","content":"Revisa su endpoint /health y sus logs en la misma ventana temporal. Después sigue la dependencia indicada: PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ, proveedor OIDC o motor criptográfico."},"2208":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting#valida-el-resultado-desde-fuera","content":"Para PKI, comprueba el certificado, la cadena, OCSP o CRL con el mismo tipo de cliente que utiliza producción."},"2209":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting#recogida-mínima-de-evidencias","content":"Sustituye los marcadores por tu release, namespace y deployment reales."},"2210":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting#recogida-mínima-de-evidencias","content":"Ejecuta también la prueba de conectividad del chart:"},"2211":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting#recogida-mínima-de-evidencias","content":"El test consulta la salud de CA, DMS Manager, Device Manager y VA, y comprueba que la UI devuelve HTML. Un test correcto confirma conectividad básica, no un flujo completo de emisión."},"2212":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting#recogida-mínima-de-evidencias","content":"Los servicios del chart exponen sondas de inicio, disponibilidad y vida sobre /health. Un pod puede estar ejecutándose pero no recibir tráfico si la readiness probe falla."},"2213":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"Si recibes un 401:"},"2214":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pk